/* maya-brand-outreach                                                      */
/*                                                                             */
/* Custom Maya skill (creator-side). Source: agents/skills/maya-brand-outreach/SKILL.md
/* Bundled by Sprint 2 Slice C — see scripts/sync-bundled-skills.ts.           */
